  Title: Oil Drops
  Body: 'Little drops of machine oil

    lead away from the freezer.

    Chefs
    and cats don''t leak oil!

    <color=#FF7361>Clean hands, happy scoops:

    <b>Nova</b>
    cones come wrapped.</color>'
